      "name": "Manovo-Gounda St Floris National Park",
      "writeup": "",
      "wiki": {
        "extract": "Manovo-Gounda St Floris National Park is a national park and UNESCO World Heritage Site located in the Central African Republic prefecture Bamingui-Bangoran, near the Chad border. It was inscribed to the list of World Heritage Sites in 1988 as a result of the diversity of life present within it.",
